# --- Data policy -----------------------------------------------------------
# One rule, applied consistently (settled 2026-08-13; it previously was not).
#
# COMMITTED: the specific third-party inputs the published results depend on,
# so the pipeline reproduces from a clean clone -- raw Cboe CSVs, the pinned
# Oxford-Man archive, the Invesco QQQ holdings snapshot, SEC N-PORT extracts,
# and the derived Cboe close panel. These are redistributed here for
# verification of the results in this repository. Each retains its original
# terms; see LICENSE and DATA-LICENSE.md. Nothing under data/ or calendars/ is
# relicensed by this repository's MIT grant.
#
# NOT COMMITTED: bulk third-party archives that are large, are not needed to
# reproduce a published number, or whose upstream provenance is undocumented.
# These are hash-audited locally and their fetch commands are in docs/DATA.md.
#
# The previous version of this file excluded the DERIVED Cboe panel on
# redistribution grounds while committing the RAW Cboe source it is built from,
# which was backwards and is the inconsistency this comment replaces.
data/free_sources/raw/

# Resumable TiRex extraction/probe caches; consolidated, hash-audited artifacts
# live beside these directories and are versioned.
data/representation_study/latent_embedding_chunks/
data/representation_study/latent_probe_work/
data/representation_study/latent_pre_repair_*/
